OptionalBinding or WrappingOptional Varaibles


3 ways to do optional binding


1- nil coalescing operator (??)

	When the value is nil and need to use some default value

	var number: Int?
	number = 12345
	print(number ?? "")

2- if let binding

     If we have the value then execute the block otherwise leave the block

var number: Int?

number = 12345
if let _number = number{
    print(_number)
}else{
	print(“no account number”)
}		

3- guard let binding

guard let _number = number else{
    print("no account number")
}


